## macOS System Files
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

## Xcode
# Build generated
build/
DerivedData/

# Configuration settings specific to the user (e.g., window layout)
*.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/

# Code signing handling (if managing manually)
# Note: Comment these out if you are syncing certificates via git (not recommended)
*.p12
*.cer

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Packages/
# Note: Keep Package.resolved! It locks your dependency versions.

## Xcode Project generation (if using tools like Xcodegen)
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/

## CocoaPods (if you use them)
# We usually ignore the Pods directory to keep the repo small
Pods/
# Do not ignore Podfile.lock!

## Carthage (if you use it)
Carthage/Build/

## Fastlane (Automation)
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/screenshots
fastlane/test_output

## Testing
*.xccheckout
*.xcresult

## Accidental files
*~.nib

## User Config
User.xcconfig
